sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Login Page
  participant Client as frontend api client
  participant AuthRoute as auth.route
  participant AuthService as auth.service
  participant TokenService as token.service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  User->>UI: 이메일과 비밀번호 입력
  UI->>Client: login(payload)
  Client->>AuthRoute: POST /api/auth/login
  AuthRoute->>AuthService: login(payload)
  AuthService->>DB: 사용자와 passwordHash 조회
  DB-->>AuthService: User
  AuthService->>AuthService: 비밀번호 검증과 계정 상태 확인
  AuthService->>TokenService: access token과 refresh token 생성
  TokenService->>DB: refresh token hash 저장
  DB-->>TokenService: 저장 완료
  TokenService-->>AuthService: token bundle
  AuthService-->>AuthRoute: LoginResult
  AuthRoute-->>Client: { data: LoginResult }
  Client-->>UI: 세션 저장
